            "review_title": "Review at Brio Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Kevin C\n2 contributions\n0\nGreat Wine experience, very satisfying food\nApr 2024 • Couples\nMy favorite Italian restaurant in Vietnam! The service here is exceptional, their modern wine machine offers a fantastic variety of wines by the glass at reasonable prices. The dishes are perfectly balanced, delivering a consistently delightful dining experience. Every visit is a pleasure. I highly recommend this place that has become my best choice for date nights\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 1, 2024\nThao Dien B\nDear Mr. Kevin, \n\nThank you so much for your kind words! We're thrilled to hear that you enjoy dining with us and that our service, wine selection, and dishes have consistently met your expectations. It's wonderful to know that we've become your top choice for date nights. We look forward to welcoming you back for more delightful experiences!\nRead more\nWritten August 15, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
